# Dev: the Next dev server runs on :3000; the yagent backend on :3001.
# Point the browser straight at the backend for REST + WebSocket. The backend's
# CORS default is '*' (config.ts webOrigin) so cross-origin REST works, and
# WebSocket isn't subject to CORS. NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined at build time.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://localhost:3001
